# Generated artifacts have exactly one authority, and it is the generator.
#
# `src/lib/contracts/*.gen.ts` is emitted by `tools/genome-codegen.py` from
# `state/genome/entity.schema.json` and gated by `genome-codegen.py --check` in
# the contracts-drift CI job. Letting prettier also own the file gives it two
# owners: `prettier --write` reformats it, the next `--check` reports drift, and
# whichever job runs last decides. That is the same "N uncoordinated copies of
# one law" shape the genome exists to remove.
src/lib/contracts/*.gen.ts

